### history-cursor.ts

```js
const CURSOR_PATTERN = /^(\d{1,16}):([A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64})$/;
```

Cursor is `<joinedAt>:<id>`. The pagination SQL:

```sql
WHERE ($1::bigint IS NULL
       OR s.joined_at < $1::bigint
       OR (s.joined_at = $1::bigint AND s.id < $2::text))
```

joinedAt up to 16 digits — epoch millis is 13 digits now, 16 digits covers until year ~3.3M. OK.

Note: id pattern `[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}` matches MeetingHistoryId pattern. Fine.

### history-database.ts adaptPglite

```js
transaction: async (work) => {
